        "comments": "The assembly mHalGry1.hap2.1 is based on 58x PacBio data and Arima2 Hi-C data generated by the Darwin Tree of Life Project\n(https://www.darwintreeoflife.org/). The assembly process included the following sequence of steps: initial PacBio assembly generation with Hifiasm in Hi-C integrated assembly mode, and Hi-C based scaffolding with YaHS. The mitochondrial genome was assembled using MitoHiFi. Finally, each haplotype assembly was analysed and manually improved using TreeVal. The exact order and orientation of the contigs on chromosome 8 (13.0 - 20.0) are unknown. The sex chromosome X was assigned by synteny to GCA_028975605.1 / Pusa sibirica.",
